{"_id":"WmProfession0001","img":"icons/tools/smithing/anvil.webp","name":"Blacksmithing","sort":10000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Blacksmithing Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Blacksmithing</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> Quick Repair</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Hellforging:</strong> Infernal weapons and armour shaped through fear, flame, sacrifice, and battle-tested tempers.</li><li><strong>Radiant Forging:</strong> Protective and cleansing equipment that channels light, healing, and defence of others.</li><li><strong>Azlanti Artifice:</strong> Ancient magitek, reverse-engineered machinery, original devices, and advanced infrastructure.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy entries are descriptive placeholders only. They do not add numerical modifiers until their rules are approved.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:blacksmithing"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","selector":"blacksmithing-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:blacksmithing"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:blacksmithing"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:blacksmithing"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Blacksmithing Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:blacksmithing"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-blacksmithing","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"blacksmithing","loreName":"Blacksmithing","craftingSpecialty":"blacksmithing","materialIds":["metal"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.ASy9AKEIRxPYUi5o","bonusFeatName":"Quick Repair","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Hellforging","description":"Infernal weapons and armour shaped through fear, flame, sacrifice, and battle-tested tempers.","proficiency":{"label":"Blacksmithing: Hellforging","description":"Dedicated Lore for Hellforging. It follows the existing Blacksmithing proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Hellforged Temper","description":"Placeholder for creating or converting compatible equipment with an approved infernal identity, such as fire, retaliation, fear, or wounded-state themes."},"mastery":{"label":"Infernal Reclamation","description":"Placeholder for repairing, upgrading, converting, and reclaiming materials from Hellforged equipment more efficiently."},"legacy":{"label":"The Hellforge","description":"Placeholder for a workshop or kingdom project capable of producing infernal military equipment and supporting specialised armies."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Radiant Forging","description":"Protective and cleansing equipment that channels light, healing, and defence of others.","proficiency":{"label":"Blacksmithing: Radiant Forging","description":"Dedicated Lore for Radiant Forging. It follows the existing Blacksmithing proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Radiant Temper","description":"Placeholder for creating compatible gear centred on protection, cleansing, light, healing, and opposition to corruption or undeath."},"mastery":{"label":"Consecrated Reforging","description":"Placeholder for efficient repair, conversion, and upgrading of Radiant equipment without defining final material costs."},"legacy":{"label":"Beacon Works","description":"Placeholder for temples, hospitals, protective wards, civic lighting, and anti-undead settlement works."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Azlanti Artifice","description":"Ancient magitek, reverse-engineered machinery, original devices, and advanced infrastructure.","proficiency":{"label":"Blacksmithing: Azlanti Artifice","description":"Dedicated Lore for Azlanti Artifice. It follows the existing Blacksmithing proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Lost Artifice","description":"Placeholder for repairing, studying, recreating, or inventing devices that combine conventional materials with mana-powered technology."},"mastery":{"label":"Reverse Engineering","description":"Placeholder for learning formulae from recovered devices and reproducing their principles without assigning research times or costs."},"legacy":{"label":"Reclaimed Infrastructure","description":"Placeholder for power systems, teleportation, automated workshops, constructs, waterworks, and advanced siege projects."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0002","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/professions/alchemy.png","name":"Alchemy","sort":20000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Alchemy Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Alchemy</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> Alchemical Crafting</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Grand Apothecary:</strong> Refined potions and elixirs tailored for stability, duration, delivery, or specialised outcomes.</li><li><strong>Venomcraft:</strong> Custom toxins shaped around delivery, persistence, concealment, onset, or a chosen quarry.</li><li><strong>Transmutative Alchemy:</strong> Controlled material conversion and the creation of specialist composite substances.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy entries are descriptive placeholders only. They do not add numerical modifiers until their rules are approved.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:alchemy"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Alchemy Profession","selector":"alchemy-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Alchemy Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:alchemy"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Alchemy Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:alchemy"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Alchemy Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:alchemy"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Alchemy Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:alchemy"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-alchemy","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"alchemy","loreName":"Alchemy","craftingSpecialty":"alchemy","materialIds":["herbs"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.is3Oz9wt11lNq62K","bonusFeatName":"Alchemical Crafting","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Grand Apothecary","description":"Refined potions and elixirs tailored for stability, duration, delivery, or specialised outcomes.","proficiency":{"label":"Alchemy: Grand Apothecary","description":"Dedicated Lore for Grand Apothecary. It follows the existing Alchemy proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Refined Formula","description":"Placeholder for choosing an approved qualitative refinement when creating a potion or elixir, such as concentrated, extended, efficient, rapid, or stable."},"mastery":{"label":"Batch Refinement","description":"Placeholder for more reliable batches, improved yield, and reduced waste without setting final quantities."},"legacy":{"label":"Public Apothecary","description":"Placeholder for hospitals, disease response, military medicine, and settlement recovery projects."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Venomcraft","description":"Custom toxins shaped around delivery, persistence, concealment, onset, or a chosen quarry.","proficiency":{"label":"Alchemy: Venomcraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Venomcraft. It follows the existing Alchemy proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Toxin Refinement","description":"Placeholder for applying an approved toxin property such as lingering, adhesive, swift, subtle, selective, or volatile."},"mastery":{"label":"Venom Harvesting","description":"Placeholder for improved harvesting, preservation, antidote work, and batch reliability without final numerical yield."},"legacy":{"label":"Civic Toxicology","description":"Placeholder for antivenoms, pest control, agricultural treatment, and specialist settlement services."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Transmutative Alchemy","description":"Controlled material conversion and the creation of specialist composite substances.","proficiency":{"label":"Alchemy: Transmutative Alchemy","description":"Dedicated Lore for Transmutative Alchemy. It follows the existing Alchemy proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Material Conversion","description":"Placeholder for transforming compatible resources or assisting another artisan in producing a new composite material."},"mastery":{"label":"Composite Refinement","description":"Placeholder for stabilising hybrid materials, reducing conversion loss, and recording repeatable transmutation formulae."},"legacy":{"label":"Transmutation Foundry","description":"Placeholder for kingdom-scale conversion of surplus commodities and access to unusual manufactured resources."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0003","img":"icons/magic/symbols/runes-star-pentagon-magenta.webp","name":"Enchanting","sort":30000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Enchanting Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Enchanting</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> Magical Crafting</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Aethercasting:</strong> Controlled magical enhancements and the incremental upgrading of empowered items.</li><li><strong>Essencebinding:</strong> Approved item traits and harvested essences bound safely into qualifying equipment.</li><li><strong>Runecarving:</strong> Efficient rune creation, upgrading, transfer, and linked Rune Echoes.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy entries are descriptive placeholders only. They do not add numerical modifiers until their rules are approved.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:enchanting"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Enchanting Profession","selector":"enchanting-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Enchanting Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:enchanting"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Enchanting Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:enchanting"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Enchanting Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:enchanting"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Enchanting Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:enchanting"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-enchanting","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"enchanting","loreName":"Enchanting","craftingSpecialty":"enchanting","materialIds":["mana-crystals"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.xWY5omyIcILNR7y1","bonusFeatName":"Magical Crafting","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Aethercasting","description":"Controlled magical enhancements and the incremental upgrading of empowered items.","proficiency":{"label":"Enchanting: Aethercasting","description":"Dedicated Lore for Aethercasting. It follows the existing Enchanting proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Empowerment","description":"Placeholder for placing one approved Aethercast enhancement onto a compatible item without defining its final value."},"mastery":{"label":"Incremental Enchantment","description":"Placeholder for upgrading or replacing an existing enhancement without rebuilding the entire item."},"legacy":{"label":"Arcane Infrastructure","description":"Placeholder for powered workshops, communication, heating, wards, and other permanent magical services."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Essencebinding","description":"Approved item traits and harvested essences bound safely into qualifying equipment.","proficiency":{"label":"Enchanting: Essencebinding","description":"Dedicated Lore for Essencebinding. It follows the existing Enchanting proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Bind Essence","description":"Placeholder for binding one approved trait or creature-derived essence to a compatible item."},"mastery":{"label":"Stable Binding","description":"Placeholder for safer transfer, replacement, preservation, and recovery of bound essences."},"legacy":{"label":"Essence Archive","description":"Placeholder for a settlement collection that identifies, stores, researches, and distributes supernatural essences."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Runecarving","description":"Efficient rune creation, upgrading, transfer, and linked Rune Echoes.","proficiency":{"label":"Enchanting: Runecarving","description":"Dedicated Lore for Runecarving. It follows the existing Enchanting proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Rune Echoing","description":"Placeholder for producing a linked or secondary rune for another qualifying item under future cost and eligibility rules."},"mastery":{"label":"Incremental Runework","description":"Placeholder for transferring, upgrading, repairing, or reproducing runes with reduced waste."},"legacy":{"label":"Runic Network","description":"Placeholder for civic wards, marked roads, defensive inscriptions, and rune-supported infrastructure."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0004","img":"icons/tools/hand/needle-grey.webp","name":"Leatherwork","sort":40000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Leatherwork Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Leatherworking</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> Experienced Tracker</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Wyrmcraft:</strong> Dragon-scale equipment that preserves an adaptation belonging to the source dragon.</li><li><strong>Beastbinding:</strong> Prepared hides that preserve a useful natural quality of the creature they came from.</li><li><strong>Mantlecraft:</strong> Prestigious and protective mantles, cloaks, robes, and environmental garments.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy entries are descriptive placeholders only. They do not add numerical modifiers until their rules are approved.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:leatherwork"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Leatherwork Profession","selector":"leatherwork-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Leatherwork Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:leatherwork"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Leatherwork Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:leatherwork"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Leatherwork Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:leatherwork"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Leatherwork Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:leatherwork"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-leatherwork","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"leatherwork","loreName":"Leatherworking","craftingSpecialty":"leatherworking","materialIds":["leather","dragon-scale"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.urQZwmzg2kS53vd5","bonusFeatName":"Experienced Tracker","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Wyrmcraft","description":"Dragon-scale equipment that preserves an adaptation belonging to the source dragon.","proficiency":{"label":"Leatherwork: Wyrmcraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Wyrmcraft. It follows the existing Leatherwork proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Draconic Essence","description":"Placeholder for retaining one approved quality associated with a dragon's colour, age, habitat, or nature."},"mastery":{"label":"Scale Conservation","description":"Placeholder for preparing, repairing, and upgrading dragon-scale work with less waste and better preservation."},"legacy":{"label":"Wyrmward Atelier","description":"Placeholder for dragon-hunting equipment, settlement wards, trophies, and specialist draconic commissions."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Beastbinding","description":"Prepared hides that preserve a useful natural quality of the creature they came from.","proficiency":{"label":"Leatherwork: Beastbinding","description":"Dedicated Lore for Beastbinding. It follows the existing Leatherwork proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Preserve the Beast","description":"Placeholder for retaining one approved natural, environmental, movement, or sensory quality from a harvested creature."},"mastery":{"label":"Master Harvester","description":"Placeholder for improved hide recovery, preservation, identification, and reuse without final yield values."},"legacy":{"label":"Bestiary Workshop","description":"Placeholder for expedition outfitting, monster-harvest services, and a settlement trade in specialised hides."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Mantlecraft","description":"Prestigious and protective mantles, cloaks, robes, and environmental garments.","proficiency":{"label":"Leatherwork: Mantlecraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Mantlecraft. It follows the existing Leatherwork proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Great Mantles","description":"Placeholder for garments offering an approved environmental, exploration, cultural, or prestige identity."},"mastery":{"label":"Luxury Craftsmanship","description":"Placeholder for exceptional finishing, repair, presentation, and the future treatment of crafted mantles as luxury goods."},"legacy":{"label":"Royal Clothier","description":"Placeholder for diplomatic gifts, court dress, luxury exports, and ceremonial settlement projects."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0005","img":"icons/tools/hand/hammer-and-nail.webp","name":"Carpentry","sort":50000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Carpentry Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Carpentry</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> Hefty Hauler</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Warbowyer:</strong> Engineered bows, crossbows, ballistae, loading systems, and specialist ammunition.</li><li><strong>Masterwright:</strong> Bridges, roads, docks, fieldworks, buildings, and major wooden structures.</li><li><strong>Warcarving:</strong> Combat forms and utility carvings applied to wooden weapons, shields, and tools.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy entries are descriptive placeholders only. They do not add numerical modifiers until their rules are approved.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:carpentry"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Carpentry Profession","selector":"carpentry-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Carpentry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:carpentry"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Carpentry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:carpentry"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Carpentry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:carpentry"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Carpentry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:carpentry"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-carpentry","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"carpentry","loreName":"Carpentry","craftingSpecialty":"woodworking","materialIds":["wood"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.C0Tcelg3BAPhML6J","bonusFeatName":"Hefty Hauler","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Warbowyer","description":"Engineered bows, crossbows, ballistae, loading systems, and specialist ammunition.","proficiency":{"label":"Carpentry: Warbowyer","description":"Dedicated Lore for Warbowyer. It follows the existing Carpentry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Engineered Ranged Weapons","description":"Placeholder for approved weapon modifications, loading mechanisms, reinforced limbs, specialised strings, and ammunition compatibility."},"mastery":{"label":"Specialist Ammunition","description":"Placeholder for efficiently producing and maintaining discovered ammunition recipes and ranged-weapon components."},"legacy":{"label":"Arsenal of the Bow","description":"Placeholder for equipping archers, settlement towers, ballista emplacements, and armies."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Masterwright","description":"Bridges, roads, docks, fieldworks, buildings, and major wooden structures.","proficiency":{"label":"Carpentry: Masterwright","description":"Dedicated Lore for Masterwright. It follows the existing Carpentry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Great Works","description":"Placeholder for planning and constructing major wooden structures as well as practical fieldworks during adventures."},"mastery":{"label":"Efficient Repairs","description":"Placeholder for improved construction, reinforcement, maintenance, salvage, and repair of wooden works."},"legacy":{"label":"Kingdom Builder","description":"Placeholder for roads, bridges, docks, palisades, settlements, and kingdom construction projects."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Warcarving","description":"Combat forms and utility carvings applied to wooden weapons, shields, and tools.","proficiency":{"label":"Carpentry: Warcarving","description":"Dedicated Lore for Warcarving. It follows the existing Carpentry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Carved Form","description":"Placeholder for adding one approved Warcarving property to compatible wooden equipment."},"mastery":{"label":"Greater Warcarvings","description":"Placeholder for discovering, combining, transferring, and maintaining advanced carved forms."},"legacy":{"label":"Totemic Works","description":"Placeholder for carved guardians, cultural monuments, war totems, and settlement-scale wooden wards."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0006","img":"icons/tools/hand/chisel-steel-brown.webp","name":"Stonemasonry","sort":60000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Stonemasonry Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Stonemasonry</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Megalithics:</strong> Monumental works, fortresses, roads, aqueducts, walls, and major civil structures.</li><li><strong>Runemasonry:</strong> Wardstones and enduring magical inscriptions that protect places rather than carried items.</li><li><strong>Titanmasonry:</strong> Stone wargear, constructs, siege engines, and powerful Titanic forms.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy entries are descriptive placeholders only. They do not add numerical modifiers until their rules are approved.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:stonemason"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Stonemasonry Profession","selector":"stonemason-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Stonemasonry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:stonemason"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Stonemasonry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:stonemason"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Stonemasonry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:stonemason"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Stonemasonry Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:stonemason"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-stonemason","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"stonemason","loreName":"Stonemasonry","craftingSpecialty":"stonemasonry","materialIds":["stone"],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Megalithics","description":"Monumental works, fortresses, roads, aqueducts, walls, and major civil structures.","proficiency":{"label":"Stonemasonry: Megalithics","description":"Dedicated Lore for Megalithics. It follows the existing Stonemasonry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Monumental Design","description":"Placeholder for planning and creating Great Works whose form, purpose, and required resources are approved project by project."},"mastery":{"label":"Master Masonry","description":"Placeholder for reliable surveying, reinforcement, repair, salvage, and efficient use of worked stone."},"legacy":{"label":"Enduring Realm","description":"Placeholder for fortresses, roads, aqueducts, monuments, walls, and kingdom-scale public works."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Runemasonry","description":"Wardstones and enduring magical inscriptions that protect places rather than carried items.","proficiency":{"label":"Stonemasonry: Runemasonry","description":"Dedicated Lore for Runemasonry. It follows the existing Stonemasonry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Wardstone","description":"Placeholder for carving an approved persistent ward, alarm, sanctuary, boundary, or environmental effect into a location."},"mastery":{"label":"Enduring Inscription","description":"Placeholder for stabilising, repairing, linking, relocating, or safely deactivating runic stonework."},"legacy":{"label":"Network of Wards","description":"Placeholder for protected roads, settlement boundaries, sanctuaries, warning stones, and regional ward networks."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Titanmasonry","description":"Stone wargear, constructs, siege engines, and powerful Titanic forms.","proficiency":{"label":"Stonemasonry: Titanmasonry","description":"Dedicated Lore for Titanmasonry. It follows the existing Stonemasonry proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Titanic Form","description":"Placeholder for an approved property applied to stone equipment, construct bodies, or siege components."},"mastery":{"label":"Construct Masonry","description":"Placeholder for assembling, repairing, reinforcing, and reclaiming large stone mechanisms and construct frames."},"legacy":{"label":"Colossus Works","description":"Placeholder for monumental guardians, siege foundries, colossal statues, and army-scale stone projects."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0007","img":"icons/commodities/materials/glass-orb-blue.webp","name":"Glassmaking","sort":70000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Glassmaking Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Glassmaking</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Prismcraft:</strong> Lenses and prisms that focus, split, redirect, or transform light and magical energy.</li><li><strong>Mirrorcraft:</strong> Reflective magic, illusions, scrying, communication, and linked mirrors.</li><li><strong>Aetherglass:</strong> Mana batteries, spell reservoirs, magical circuitry, construct cores, and powered components.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy entries are descriptive placeholders only. They do not add numerical modifiers until their rules are approved.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:glassmaking"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Glassmaking Profession","selector":"glassmaking-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Glassmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:glassmaking"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Glassmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:glassmaking"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Glassmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:glassmaking"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Glassmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:glassmaking"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-glassmaking","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"glassmaking","loreName":"Glassmaking","craftingSpecialty":"glassmaking","materialIds":[],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Prismcraft","description":"Lenses and prisms that focus, split, redirect, or transform light and magical energy.","proficiency":{"label":"Glassmaking: Prismcraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Prismcraft. It follows the existing Glassmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Focused Prism","description":"Placeholder for creating an optical or arcane component with one approved focusing, splitting, redirecting, or filtering function."},"mastery":{"label":"Precision Optics","description":"Placeholder for calibration, miniaturisation, repair, and reliable reproduction of specialist lenses and prisms."},"legacy":{"label":"Beacon Network","description":"Placeholder for observatories, lighthouses, signalling systems, illumination, and arcane energy relays."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Mirrorcraft","description":"Reflective magic, illusions, scrying, communication, and linked mirrors.","proficiency":{"label":"Glassmaking: Mirrorcraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Mirrorcraft. It follows the existing Glassmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Bound Reflection","description":"Placeholder for an approved reflective, revealing, concealing, communicating, or scrying property."},"mastery":{"label":"Linked Mirrors","description":"Placeholder for attuning, repairing, securing, and reproducing compatible mirrors as part of a controlled network."},"legacy":{"label":"Looking-Glass Network","description":"Placeholder for long-distance communication, observation, public information, and defensive mirror installations."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Aetherglass","description":"Mana batteries, spell reservoirs, magical circuitry, construct cores, and powered components.","proficiency":{"label":"Glassmaking: Aetherglass","description":"Dedicated Lore for Aetherglass. It follows the existing Glassmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Arcane Vessel","description":"Placeholder for glass components that safely store, channel, regulate, or release magical energy."},"mastery":{"label":"Stable Reservoir","description":"Placeholder for improved containment, recharge, repair, compatibility, and recovery of aetherglass components."},"legacy":{"label":"Aethergrid","description":"Placeholder for settlement power storage, magical distribution, construct support, and advanced workshop infrastructure."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0008","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/professions/pottery.png","name":"Pottery","sort":80000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Pottery Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Pottery</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Ceramancy:</strong> Living clay, terracotta constructs, ceramic armour, figurines, and guardians.</li><li><strong>Reliquarycraft:</strong> Vessels that preserve blessings, curses, spirits, essences, and planar energy.</li><li><strong>Pyroceramics:</strong> Crucibles, bomb casings, heat-resistant vessels, magical kilns, and industrial ceramics.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy entries are descriptive placeholders only. They do not add numerical modifiers until their rules are approved.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:pottery"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Pottery Profession","selector":"pottery-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Pottery Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:pottery"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Pottery Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:pottery"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Pottery Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:pottery"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Pottery Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:pottery"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-pottery","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"pottery","loreName":"Pottery","craftingSpecialty":"pottery","materialIds":[],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Ceramancy","description":"Living clay, terracotta constructs, ceramic armour, figurines, and guardians.","proficiency":{"label":"Pottery: Ceramancy","description":"Dedicated Lore for Ceramancy. It follows the existing Pottery proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Awakened Clay","description":"Placeholder for shaping an approved animated, responsive, protective, or creature-like ceramic creation."},"mastery":{"label":"Kiln-Bound Forms","description":"Placeholder for stronger firing, reliable animation, repair, reshaping, and recovery of prepared clay."},"legacy":{"label":"Terracotta Host","description":"Placeholder for civic guardians, ceremonial figures, labouring constructs, and defensive terracotta works."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Reliquarycraft","description":"Vessels that preserve blessings, curses, spirits, essences, and planar energy.","proficiency":{"label":"Pottery: Reliquarycraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Reliquarycraft. It follows the existing Pottery proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Sealed Essence","description":"Placeholder for containing one approved supernatural presence or influence inside a purpose-built vessel."},"mastery":{"label":"Enduring Vessel","description":"Placeholder for safer sealing, transport, identification, transfer, repair, and controlled release."},"legacy":{"label":"Reliquary Vault","description":"Placeholder for temples, archives, spirit houses, quarantine stores, and settlement-scale supernatural containment."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Pyroceramics","description":"Crucibles, bomb casings, heat-resistant vessels, magical kilns, and industrial ceramics.","proficiency":{"label":"Pottery: Pyroceramics","description":"Dedicated Lore for Pyroceramics. It follows the existing Pottery proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Forgeware","description":"Placeholder for a heat-, pressure-, reaction-, or impact-resistant ceramic component designed for a specific craft."},"mastery":{"label":"Thermal Mastery","description":"Placeholder for reliable firing, repair, reuse, safe handling, and specialist kiln processes."},"legacy":{"label":"Grand Kilns","description":"Placeholder for industrial ceramics, alchemical production, foundry support, fireproof construction, and settlement manufacturing."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0009","img":"icons/tools/hand/needle-grey.webp","name":"Weaving","sort":90000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Weaving Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Weaving</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Aetherweaving:</strong> Manathread and magical cloth that carry enchantments, wards, and arcane patterns.</li><li><strong>Ironweaving:</strong> Warcloth, armour backing, nets, ropes, bowstrings, sails, and resilient reinforcement.</li><li><strong>Heraldweaving:</strong> Standards, banners, and tapestries supporting morale, identity, armies, and prestige.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy entries are descriptive placeholders only. They do not add numerical modifiers until their rules are approved.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:weaving"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Weaving Profession","selector":"weaving-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Weaving Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:weaving"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Weaving Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:weaving"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Weaving Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:weaving"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Weaving Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:weaving"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-weaving","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"weaving","loreName":"Weaving","craftingSpecialty":"weaving","materialIds":[],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Aetherweaving","description":"Manathread and magical cloth that carry enchantments, wards, and arcane patterns.","proficiency":{"label":"Weaving: Aetherweaving","description":"Dedicated Lore for Aetherweaving. It follows the existing Weaving proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Manathread","description":"Placeholder for creating a magical textile component able to host an approved enchantment, ward, resistance, or arcane pattern."},"mastery":{"label":"Resonant Weave","description":"Placeholder for stabilising, repairing, combining, reclaiming, and reworking magical thread and cloth."},"legacy":{"label":"Aetherloom","description":"Placeholder for magical textile workshops, civic wards, specialist uniforms, and settlement enchantment projects."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Ironweaving","description":"Warcloth, armour backing, nets, ropes, bowstrings, sails, and resilient reinforcement.","proficiency":{"label":"Weaving: Ironweaving","description":"Dedicated Lore for Ironweaving. It follows the existing Weaving proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Warcloth","description":"Placeholder for one approved structural, restraining, protective, or load-bearing property on a compatible textile component."},"mastery":{"label":"Reinforced Weave","description":"Placeholder for improved durability, repair, recovery, fitting, and production of demanding technical textiles."},"legacy":{"label":"Realmworks Textile","description":"Placeholder for army outfitting, rigging, sails, bridges, nets, logistics, and large-scale reinforced fabrics."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Heraldweaving","description":"Standards, banners, and tapestries supporting morale, identity, armies, and prestige.","proficiency":{"label":"Weaving: Heraldweaving","description":"Dedicated Lore for Heraldweaving. It follows the existing Weaving proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Living Standard","description":"Placeholder for a banner or tapestry carrying an approved identity, morale, rallying, ceremonial, or communicative purpose."},"mastery":{"label":"Battle Heraldry","description":"Placeholder for preserving, repairing, adapting, documenting, and reproducing meaningful standards."},"legacy":{"label":"Banner of the Realm","description":"Placeholder for army standards, public ceremonies, diplomatic gifts, cultural records, and kingdom prestige."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0010","img":"icons/sundries/books/book-tooled-gold-brown.webp","name":"Bookmaking","sort":100000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Bookmaking Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Bookmaking</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Grimoirecraft:</strong> Living spellbooks and codices with enhanced memory, resonance, organisation, and access.</li><li><strong>Chroniclecraft:</strong> Lore, formulae, techniques, and Codices of Mastery that make recorded knowledge usable.</li><li><strong>Grand Cartography:</strong> Master atlases for exploration, resources, roads, armies, settlements, and expansion.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy entries are descriptive placeholders only. They do not add numerical modifiers until their rules are approved.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:bookmaking"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Bookmaking Profession","selector":"bookmaking-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Bookmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:bookmaking"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Bookmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:bookmaking"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Bookmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:bookmaking"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Bookmaking Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:bookmaking"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-bookmaking","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"bookmaking","loreName":"Bookmaking","craftingSpecialty":"bookmaking","materialIds":[],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Grimoirecraft","description":"Living spellbooks and codices with enhanced memory, resonance, organisation, and access.","proficiency":{"label":"Bookmaking: Grimoirecraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Grimoirecraft. It follows the existing Bookmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Living Grimoire","description":"Placeholder for a spellbook or codex with one approved memory, access, resonance, indexing, or protective quality."},"mastery":{"label":"Resonant Binding","description":"Placeholder for repairing, expanding, reorganising, copying, securing, and preserving magical books."},"legacy":{"label":"Great Library","description":"Placeholder for magical archives, public learning, spell research, secure collections, and learned settlement institutions."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Chroniclecraft","description":"Lore, formulae, techniques, and Codices of Mastery that make recorded knowledge usable.","proficiency":{"label":"Bookmaking: Chroniclecraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Chroniclecraft. It follows the existing Bookmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Codex of Mastery","description":"Placeholder for recording one approved body of Lore, formulae, techniques, testimony, or practical instruction."},"mastery":{"label":"Perfect Record","description":"Placeholder for verification, indexing, restoration, translation, copying, and protection against lost or corrupted knowledge."},"legacy":{"label":"Archive of Ages","description":"Placeholder for legal records, histories, formula libraries, schools, and knowledge shared across a kingdom."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Grand Cartography","description":"Master atlases for exploration, resources, roads, armies, settlements, and expansion.","proficiency":{"label":"Bookmaking: Grand Cartography","description":"Dedicated Lore for Grand Cartography. It follows the existing Bookmaking proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Master Atlas","description":"Placeholder for a map or atlas that records an approved route, resource, hazard, boundary, settlement, or exploration insight."},"mastery":{"label":"Living Survey","description":"Placeholder for updating, reconciling, copying, protecting, and expanding maps as new information is discovered."},"legacy":{"label":"Royal Cartographic Office","description":"Placeholder for kingdom surveys, roads, borders, armies, resource planning, settlement growth, and exploration records."}}}]}}}}
{"_id":"WmProfession0011","img":"modules/pf2e-crafting-material-tiers/assets/professions/tailoring.png","name":"Tailoring","sort":110000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"bonus","description":{"value":"<p><strong>Tailoring Profession</strong></p>\n<p>This is a Wrathmaker profession chosen at 1st level. It supplies the appropriate Specialty Crafting benefit and Additional Lore for the profession.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Profession Lore:</strong> Tailoring</li>\n<li><strong>Automatic Lore proficiency:</strong> trained at level 1, expert at level 3, master at level 7, and legendary at level 15.</li>\n<li><strong>Profession development:</strong> at levels 4, 10, and 16, choose a specialty of the starting profession or learn a new profession.</li>\n<li><strong>Relevant profession checks:</strong> +2 circumstance bonus.</li>\n<li><strong>Additional feat:</strong> To be determined</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Specialisations</strong></p>\n<ol><li><strong>Battlestitching:</strong> Combat garments and armour liners designed for movement, access, protection, and adaptation.</li><li><strong>Veilcraft:</strong> Supernatural disguises, stealth clothing, concealing mantles, and perception-altering garments.</li><li><strong>Regaliacraft:</strong> Vestments of authority supporting diplomacy, leadership, morale, royal courts, and prestige.</li></ol>\n<p><em>Signature, Mastery, and Legacy entries are descriptive placeholders only. They do not add numerical modifiers until their rules are approved.</em></p>"},"level":{"value":1},"maxTakable":1,"prerequisites":{"value":[]},"publication":{"license":"ORC","remaster":true,"title":"Wrathmaker"},"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"wrathmaker:profession:tailoring"},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Tailoring Profession","selector":"tailoring-lore","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Tailoring Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:tailoring"],"selector":"arcana","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Tailoring Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:tailoring"],"selector":"crafting","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Tailoring Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:tailoring"],"selector":"nature","type":"circumstance","value":2},{"key":"FlatModifier","label":"Tailoring Profession","predicate":["wrathmaker:profession-check:tailoring"],"selector":"survival","type":"circumstance","value":2}],"slug":"wrathmaker-profession-tailoring","traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["general","skill"]}},"type":"feat","flags":{"pf2e-crafting-material-tiers":{"profession":{"schemaVersion":3,"id":"tailoring","loreName":"Tailoring","craftingSpecialty":"tailoring","materialIds":[],"checkBonus":2,"checkBonusType":"circumstance","bonusFeatUuid":"","bonusFeatName":"To be determined","specialties":[{"id":"specialty-1","label":"Battlestitching","description":"Combat garments and armour liners designed for movement, access, protection, and adaptation.","proficiency":{"label":"Tailoring: Battlestitching","description":"Dedicated Lore for Battlestitching. It follows the existing Tailoring proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Battle Garment","description":"Placeholder for one approved mobility, resistance, access, fitting, or protective quality on compatible clothing or armour lining."},"mastery":{"label":"Adaptive Fitting","description":"Placeholder for refitting, repairing, reinforcing, reclaiming, and upgrading combat garments for a new wearer or purpose."},"legacy":{"label":"Military Atelier","description":"Placeholder for specialised uniforms, expedition clothing, army outfitting, and protective public equipment."}}},{"id":"specialty-2","label":"Veilcraft","description":"Supernatural disguises, stealth clothing, concealing mantles, and perception-altering garments.","proficiency":{"label":"Tailoring: Veilcraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Veilcraft. It follows the existing Tailoring proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Veiled Garment","description":"Placeholder for one approved disguise, concealment, misdirection, identity, or perception-altering quality."},"mastery":{"label":"Perfect Masquerade","description":"Placeholder for tailoring, retuning, repairing, concealing, and safely changing the identity held by a veil."},"legacy":{"label":"House of Veils","description":"Placeholder for diplomacy, intelligence work, theatre, ceremonial disguise, secure couriers, and covert kingdom projects."}}},{"id":"specialty-3","label":"Regaliacraft","description":"Vestments of authority supporting diplomacy, leadership, morale, royal courts, and prestige.","proficiency":{"label":"Tailoring: Regaliacraft","description":"Dedicated Lore for Regaliacraft. It follows the existing Tailoring proficiency progression; no separate numerical benefit is assigned yet."},"stages":{"signature":{"label":"Vestment of Authority","description":"Placeholder for regalia carrying an approved ceremonial, diplomatic, leadership, morale, or institutional identity."},"mastery":{"label":"Courtly Craft","description":"Placeholder for authenticating, restoring, adapting, documenting, and reproducing significant regalia."},"legacy":{"label":"Royal Regalia","description":"Placeholder for coronations, courts, diplomatic gifts, public offices, national identity, and kingdom prestige."}}}]}}}}
